**\n- **Rollback:** payments-worker is on v3.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It's now healthy, with a 0.2% error rate.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for payments-worker, and on-call has been paged. The first attempt to create it timed out. I retried with the same request key, which stops a duplicate incident or page from being created.\n\n**Still open:** payments-api is still on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate after the payments-worker rollback. So the worker may not be the only cause, or payments-api may just need time to recover. I've noted this in the incident. If payments-api doesn't recover soon, I'd suggest rolling it back to v5.0.0. I haven't done that because the approver denied it earlier, so I need your go-ahead first.", "type": "text"}]}]}